{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30638","headline":"随州献李侍御二首 二 · 姚鹄","name":"随州献李侍御二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"再刖未甘何处说，但垂双泪出咸秦。\n风尘匹马来千里，蓬梗全家望一身。\n旧隐每怀空竟夕，愁眉不展几经春。\n今朝傥降非常顾，倒屐宁惟有古人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}